* Auto-generated testbench for RC filter: R304/C301
* Type: low-pass, expected fc = 3444.9 Hz
* Model: ideal passives (exact for RC)


R304 BUCK_COMP COMP_RC 14k

C301 COMP_RC 0 3.3n

* AC stimulus
VAC BUCK_COMP 0 DC 0 AC 1

.control
ac dec 100 34.45 344.5k
meas ac fc_sim when vdb(COMP_RC)=-3
meas ac phase_fc find vp(COMP_RC) at=fc_sim
echo "fc_sim=$&fc_sim phase_fc=$&phase_fc has_parasitics=0" > E:/Projects/duck-robot/docs/references/hat-simulation-tools-20261029/amp-decoupling-20261031/spice-work/rc-filter_R304_C301.out
quit
.endc

.end
